    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/a91600e327bad547d033fb7445e60f81.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=181 /></span><br><strong>LUM'S GAME</strong> is a horror life-sim adventure game about growing a garden with your family, and taking care of their strange pet named LUM. Help Mom grow a beautiful garden. Check up on Dad in the kitchen. Play with the neighborhood kids. Uncover horrifying family secrets in your dreams. And, most importantly, take care of LUM! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/6acb8295b7e2fcf5ccd841790dad75b1.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=100 /></span>Grow a beautiful flower garden in the back yard. Water, get rid of pests, and even talk to your flowers to help them grow! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/f08575531867c779951352802cb590ea.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=100 /></span>LUM is a ball-shaped creature that loves to eat, and gets frightened easily. Feed them different kinds of food to gain a daily boost, and pet them to calm down their anxiety!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/3757a0a53a931acaea0744fd9481f04f.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=100 /></span> Tuck LUM into bed at night, and see what they're dreaming about. Hm, these dreams are kind of strange and scary...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/5805576eb717a7dd48f245efd80063da.poster.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/5805576eb717a7dd48f245efd80063da.webm?t=1735570798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/a91600e327bad547d033fb7445e60f81.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=181 /></span><br><strong>LUM'S GAME</strong> is a horror life-sim adventure game about growing a garden with your family, and taking care of their strange pet named LUM. Help Mom grow a beautiful garden. Check up on Dad in the kitchen. Play with the neighborhood kids. Uncover horrifying family secrets in your dreams. And, most importantly, take care of LUM! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/6acb8295b7e2fcf5ccd841790dad75b1.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=100 /></span>Grow a beautiful flower garden in the back yard. Water, get rid of pests, and even talk to your flowers to help them grow! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/f08575531867c779951352802cb590ea.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=100 /></span>LUM is a ball-shaped creature that loves to eat, and gets frightened easily. Feed them different kinds of food to gain a daily boost, and pet them to calm down their anxiety!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/3757a0a53a931acaea0744fd9481f04f.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=100 /></span> Tuck LUM into bed at night, and see what they're dreaming about. Hm, these dreams are kind of strange and scary...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/5805576eb717a7dd48f245efd80063da.poster.avif?t=1735570798\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600240/extras/5805576eb717a7dd48f245efd80063da.webm?t=1735570798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
